## Motivation

ROCm partial DP attention (for example TP8/EP4/DPA2) had two classes of failures on MI355X:

1. Decode CUDA-graph capture could abort with `hipErrorCapturedEvent` when a ProcessGroup/custom-all-reduce event was queried from a capturing stream.
2. After the capture crash was removed, batched speculative decode silently produced corrupted activations and incoherent output. Full GSM8K was 0/1,319 strict before the correctness fixes.

